{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/factory.ts",
    "title": "检索后端工厂",
    "summary": "读取严格的检索配置，并在默认关键词检索与启用后的本地中文语义检索之间切换，同时向调用方统一暴露关闭钩子。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "configuration",
        "title": "配置合同",
        "body": "配置只允许 `enabled` 和 `osdkModel` 两项：前者默认关闭语义检索，后者默认指向 `memory-zh`，且别名只能包含字母、数字、下划线和连字符。读取函数直接解析 JSON 并交给严格 schema，因此未知字段、非法别名或格式错误都会在启动配置阶段暴露。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "selection",
        "title": "后端选择与生命周期",
        "body": "未提供配置或未启用时，工厂直接构造 SQLite 关键词检索，并返回无操作的异步关闭函数。启用后则构造 `SemanticRetrieval`，把中文 embedding 加载器作为延迟工厂传入，立即调用 `start()`，关闭时委托语义后端释放资源。[[c2]] 因而该模块是后端装配点：它依赖统一 `RetrievalPort`、关键词实现、语义实现和模型加载器，但不参与排序算法或向量计算本身。"
      },
      {
        "key": "boundary",
        "title": "可见边界",
        "body": "这里的回退只由配置开关决定，并未出现“语义初始化失败后自动退回关键词检索”的处理。`start()` 是否同步抛错、后台失败如何反映到健康状态，取决于未提供的 `SemanticRetrieval` 实现，不能由本文件确认。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "检索配置解析",
        "reason": "支持严格配置字段、默认值和模型别名格式的说明。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/factory.ts",
          "startLine": 9,
          "endLine": 13
        },
        "quote": "export const retrievalConfigSchema = z.object({ enabled: z.boolean().default(false), osdkModel: z.string().regex(/^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$/).default(\"memory-zh\") }).strict();\nexport type RetrievalConfig = z.input<typeof retrievalConfigSchema>;\nexport function readRetrievalConfig(path: string) {\n  return retrievalConfigSchema.p"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "关键词与语义后端选择",
        "reason": "说明关闭时采用关键词检索，启用时启动语义检索并提供关闭钩子。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/factory.ts",
          "startLine": 14,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "export function createRetrieval(db: DatabaseSync, config?: RetrievalConfig, cwd = process.cwd()): { retrieval: RetrievalPort; close: () => Promise<void> } {\n  if (!config?.enabled) return { retrieval: new KeywordRetrieval(db), close: async () => {} };\n  const retrieval = new SemanticRetrieval(db, () => loadChineseEmbed"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "语义检索启动调用",
        "reason": "支持本文件没有捕获 start 异常或声明自动降级策略这一边界判断。",
        "relation": "calls",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/retrieval/factory.ts",
          "startLine": 14,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "export function createRetrieval(db: DatabaseSync, config?: RetrievalConfig, cwd = process.cwd()): { retrieval: RetrievalPort; close: () => Promise<void> } {\n  if (!config?.enabled) return { retrieval: new KeywordRetrieval(db), close: async () => {} };\n  const retrieval = new SemanticRetrieval(db, () => loadChineseEmbed"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "语义模型加载或后台索引失败时，服务是否继续提供关键词检索？",
        "why": "工厂启用语义模式后只创建并启动 SemanticRetrieval，没有可见的异常捕获或显式 fallback；缺少 semantic.ts 材料，无法判断其内部健康状态和降级策略。",
        "nextStep": "检查 SemanticRetrieval.start、health 和 search 的错误路径，并验证模型缺失、摘要不符与索引失败三种场景。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c2",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
